# Core database migrations

**Audience:** Core developers.

**Status:** internal Alembic migration environment, not an installation or
upgrade procedure.

The current Docker Core startup invokes the migration runner. A migration being
marked applied proves only that its migration function returned; it does not
necessarily prove that presenter-dependent presets or other operational data
were installed successfully.

Do not run historical migration data functions manually against a newer schema
or use this directory as a repair interface. Back up the database and follow
release-specific, tested upgrade instructions when those are available.
